+* Date: Wed, 25 Jun 1997 12:48:26 +0200 (MET DST)
+* MIME-Version: 1.0
+* From: R.Hooft@EuroMail.com (Rob Hooft)
+* To: g77-alpha@gnu.ai.mit.edu
+* Subject: Re: testing 970624.
+* In-Reply-To: <199706251027.GAA07892@churchy.gnu.ai.mit.edu>
