+/* Missing warning for falling off the end of a non-void function.
+   egcs-1.1.2 passes, egcs-ss-19990428 fails.
+   http://egcs.cygnus.com/ml/egcs-bugs/1999-03/msg00220.html */
+/* { dg-do compile } */
